                                                "example_id": "173264ff-cd51-41f9-9407-8a23886361fd",
                                                "sense_id": "7ef2cb9c-439c-32b8-9f2e-2c50897fbccb",
                                                "text": "Just like down in Texas when I was rangering, you just keep turning over rocks […]"
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "20029397-f954-4d70-9828-e26c45c6ff4b",
                                                "sense_id": "7ef2cb9c-439c-32b8-9f2e-2c50897fbccb",
                                                "text": "He saw men long dead whom he had rangered with, saw Pedro Flores and Pea Eye and a redheaded whore he had taken up with for a month in his riverboating days."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
